-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-05, with and without QAOP +
              Space: approved

  Replay      IDENTICAL on 5 recordings, 123,765 frames, in both colour sets:
              142,954 moves, 5,363 toggles, 91 saved-image toggles, 133,780
              paints, 821 clears, every hook run; at every hook original and
              patched code compared from the same state, every register with
              R, memory, sprite pixels against the original's XOR; the
              Enhanced build beside the default at all 283,009 hook events; 14
              of 14 negatives detected in replays, a forced 3.5 MHz exit and R
              one off among them, 2 Enhanced negatives detected, controls at
              3.5 and 7 MHz clean; ROM path check clean on both builds

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: loading screen, title and play reached
              from the build's own BASIC start in both colour sets, frames
              inspected; flicker check clean in both sets (300 frames);
              15-minute soak in both sets: no freeze, loop or crash, play,
              game overs and restarts on the sheet; the .nxc menu builds of
              both sets reach play, cheats on and off

  Coverage    Bot recordings only, no human play: rooms near the start and 34
              rooms with cheats, deaths, game over, hall of fame, two-player
              games, the ending by a cheat; not reached: the amulet collected
              by a player, the cave, joysticks

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
